    {
      "id": "PR_kwDONqt9zM7fGwfx",
      "title": "feat: deployment factory deps + diversified user metrics (#12, #13)",
      "author": "Hobie1Kenobi",
      "number": 101,
      "body": "## Summary\n\n### Issue #12 — Deployment factories\n- Recognize CREATE_FACTORY / DEPLOYMENT_FACTORY dependency sources as CREATE_FACTORY_DEPENDENCY links\n- Include factory links in package-like EigenTrust propagation with configurable decay/weights\n- Proposal doc + example devtooling weight YAML\n\n### Issue #13 — User metrics beyond Farcaster\n- Add optional user_metric_blend config to synthesize composite user-activity metrics\n- Enables blending Farcaster, KYC, CEX-linked, and heuristic onchain user signals\n- Proposal doc + example onchain weight YAML\n\n## Tests\n- eval-algos/core/models/tests/test_proposals.py (link-type mapping + blend injection)\n\nCloses #12\nCloses #13\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/Retro-Funding",
